        "## **Objective**\n",
        "\n",
        "The objective of this assignment is to explore the practical applications of a Variational Autoencoder (VAE) using the MNIST dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "The assignment focuses on:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Data compression using the latent representation of a VAE.\n",
        "- Image reconstruction by encoding and decoding MNIST images.\n",
        "- Image denoising by adding Gaussian noise and passing noisy images through the trained VAE.\n",
        "- Studying how changing the latent dimension affects compression ratio and reconstruction quality."
