        "# **Part B: Image Reconstruction**\n",
        "\n",
        "In this part, 10 MNIST test images are passed through the trained VAE.\n",
        "\n",
        "The images are first encoded into the latent space and then decoded to reconstruct the original images.\n",
        "\n",
        "Mean Squared Error (MSE) is used to measure reconstruction quality."
      ],
      "metadata": {
